  "schema:name": "DOB Job Application Filings",
  "schema:description": "This dataset contains all job applications submitted through the Borough Offices, through eFiling, or through the HUB, which have a \"Latest Action Date\" since January 1, 2000. This dataset does not include jobs submitted through DOB NOW. See the DOB NOW: Build – Job Application Filings dataset for DOB NOW jobs.",
